{"id":842307,"title":"18｜生成图片压缩功能","content":"本节课介绍了如何在网站中实现图片压缩功能。首先，将网站功能规划、图片压缩示意图、目录结构及代码架构设计文档添加到上下文，并给出提示词生成图片压缩功能。尽管系统建议创建后端服务，但实际上该功能无需后端支持。启动前后端服务时遇到问题，通过手动重启解决了前端服务无法自动启动的问题。网页显示异常，通过多次提交错误信息并重启前端服务，最终使页面正常显示。发现界面布局和功能逻辑存在问题，如缺少压缩按钮、布局不合理等，通过向composer提供具体修改意见，逐步优化了用户界面与操作流程。测试过程中还发现下载文件格式错误的bug，经调整后得到解决。课程最后留有作业，要求学员自行修正菜单显示问题以及独立完成剩余三个功能的开发。下一课将介绍chrome插件开发，用于网页内容翻译与总结。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":399243,"user_name":"海狗菌Hisen","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1077102,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"4BA69F21A72E88","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/6f/6e/d0d43426.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1743579851,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144921,"content":"项目代码都在网盘里一起提供了的","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1743649460,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":399243,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"请问有项目代码吗？ 百度网盘没有找到","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":659270,"discussion_content":"项目代码都在网盘里一起提供了的","content_length":15,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1743649460,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397703,"user_name":"Peter","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1139456,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"9134384E270966","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/63/00/c0731586.jpg","comment_is_top":false,